  <section class="content-section">
    <h2 id="tos-description">Description of Service</h2>
    <p>
      TornManager is a tool I created for players of Torn.com, available as a web application at tornmanager.com.
      My service uses the official Torn API to help you:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Track your personal statistics and progress over time</li>
      <li>Monitor stat enhancer usage and gains</li>
      <li>Analyze dividend stock investments and break-even calculations</li>
      <li>View Hall of Fame statistics for top players</li>
      <li>Monitor faction member training compliance (for tracked factions)</li>
      <li>View faction ranked war history and member performance</li>
      <li>View live war dashboards with enemy status and spy data during ranked wars</li>
      <li>Share live war dashboards publicly with allies via password-protected lobbies</li>
      <li>Configure faction whitelists for controlled data sharing between factions</li>
      <li>Share subscription time with faction members (faction leaders only)</li>
      <li>Access all features from any device &mdash; fully mobile-friendly</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      TornManager is a read-only service that displays and analyzes data from Torn. I do not modify your 
      Torn account or perform any actions on your behalf.
    </p>
  </section>

