            <td>Track personal progress, statistics, and investment analysis</td>
            <td>Stored in database / Used only for automation</td>
            <td>Public Only (minimum); Limited Access (for stock features)</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    
    <p>
      For a complete list of API endpoints used and detailed information about data collection, please see my 
      <a href="#pp-api-usage">Privacy Policy</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

